-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Biome\" title=\"Classic Biome\">Classic Biome</a> | Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Classic Store</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$1,337</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">when 2 players hold the sword they can fight</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe Linked Sword can be used only when 2 players hold the sword and in that case they can fight.\n</p><p>It costs $1,337 at the <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a>, or there is a small chance of it dropping from killing skeletons in the acidlands.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The price of the sword refers to the old Roblox saying, 1337, refers to the term \"leet,\" which was often used to describe a person as skilled or elite, which originated from the 1980's. It was commonly used during the early days of Roblox.</li>\n<li>Despite being a weapon, it does no damage to NPC enemies.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901093545\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 51/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019488/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.129      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   31.129      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1192-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901093545 and revision id 20303. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools"],"links":[{"title":"Classic Biome","exists":true},{"title":"Classic Store","exists":true}],"images":["Linked_Sword.png"]}
